"value": "0000-0002-9750-5771"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "University of Michigan, Ann Arbor."}]}}, {"fullName": "Lin CJF", "lastName": "Lin", "firstName": "Celia J F", "initials": "CJF", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Genentech, South San Francisco, California."}]}}, {"fullName": "Goldin J", "lastName": "Goldin", "firstName": "Jonathan", "initials": "J", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "University of California, Los Angeles."}]}}, {"fullName": "Kim GH", "lastName": "Kim", "firstName": "Grace Hyun", "initials": "GH", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-1225-3489"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "University of California, Los Angeles."}]}}, {"fullName": "Furst DE", "lastName": "Furst", "firstName": "Daniel E", "initials": "DE", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "University of California, Los Angeles, University of Washington, Seattle, and University of Florence, Florence, Italy."}]}}, {"fullName": "Denton CP", "lastName": "Denton", "firstName": "Christopher P", "initials": "CP", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-3975-8938"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "University College London, London, UK."}]}}, {"fullName": "Huang S", "lastName": "Huang", "firstName": "Suiyuan", "initials": "S", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "University of Michigan, Ann Arbor."}]}}, {"fullName": "Khanna D", "lastName": "Khanna", "firstName": "Dinesh", "initials": "D", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-1412-4453"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "University of Michigan, Ann Arbor."}]}}, {"collectiveName": "focuSSced Investigators"}]}, "authorIdList": {"authorId": [{"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-9750-5771"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-1225-3489"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-1412-4453"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-3975-8938"}]}, "dataLinksTagsList": {"dataLinkstag": ["altmetrics", "supporting_data"]}, "journalInfo": {"issue": "7", "volume": "73", "journalIssueId": 3191711, "dateOfPublication": "2021 Jul", "monthOfPublication": 7, "yearOfPublication": 2021, "journal": {"medlineAbbreviation": "Arthritis Rheumatol", "title": "Arthritis & rheumatology (Hoboken, N.J.)", "essn": "2326-5205", "issn": "2326-5191", "isoabbreviation": "Arthritis Rheumatol", "nlmid": "101623795"}, "printPublicationDate": "2021-07-01"}, "pubYear": "2021", "pageInfo": "1301-1310", "abstractText": "<h4>Objective</h4>Tocilizumab (TCZ) has demonstrated lung function preservation in 2 randomized controlled trials in early systemic sclerosis (SSc). This effect has yet to be characterized in terms of radiographically evident quantitative lung involvement. We undertook this study to assess the impact of TCZ on lung function preservation in a post hoc analysis, stratifying treatment arms according to the degree of lung involvement.<h4>Methods</h4>The focuSSced trial was a phase III randomized placebo-controlled trial of TCZ in patients with SSc and progressive skin disease. Participants underwent baseline and serial spirometry along with high-resolution chest computed tomography at baseline and at week 48. Quantitative interstitial lung disease (QILD) and fibrosis scores were assessed by computer software. We classified QILD into the following categories of lung involvement: mild (>5-10%), moderate (>10-20%), and severe (>20%).<h4>Results</h4>Of 210 participants recruited for the trial, 136 patients (65%) had ILD. The majority of these patients (77%) had moderate-to-severe involvement (defined as >10% lung involvement). The TCZ arm demonstrated preservation of forced vital capacity percent predicted (FVC%) over 48 weeks (least squares mean change in FVC% = -0.1) compared to placebo (-6.3%). For mild, moderate, and severe QILD, the mean ± SD change in FVC% in the TCZ arm at 48 weeks were -4.1 ± 2.5% (n = 11), 0.7 ± 1.9% (n =19), and 2.1 ± 1.6% (n = 26), respectively, and in the placebo group were -10.0 ± 2.6% (n = 11), -5.7 ± 1.6% (n = 26), and -6.7 ± 2.0% (n = 16), respectively. Similar treatment-related preservation findings were seen independent of fibrosis severity.<h4>Conclusion</h4>TCZ in early SSc-associated ILD with progressive skin disease stabilized FVC% over 48 weeks, independent of the extent of radiographically evident QILD.", "affiliation": "University of Michigan, Ann Arbor.", "publicationStatus": "ppublish", "language": "eng", "pubModel": "Print-Electronic", "pubTypeList": {"pubType": ["Clinical Trial, Phase III", "research-article", "Randomized Controlled Trial", "Journal Article", "Research Support, N.I.H., Extramural"]}, "grantsList": {"grant": [{"agency": "NIAMS NIH HHS", "acronym": "AR", "grantId": "R43 AR063129", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "NIAMS NIH HHS", "acronym": "AR", "grantId": "T32 AR007080", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Institute of Arthritis and Musculoskeletal and Skin Diseases", "grantId": "T32‐AR007080", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Institute of Arthritis and Musculoskeletal and Skin Diseases", "grantId": "K24‐AR‐063129", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "NIAMS NIH HHS", "acronym": "AR", "grantId": "R01 AR070470", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "NIAMS NIH HHS", "acronym": "AR", "grantId": "K24 AR063120", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Institute of Arthritis and Musculoskeletal and Skin Diseases", "grantId": "1R01‐AR070470‐01A1", "orderIn": 0}]}, "meshHeadingList": {"meshHeading": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Lung", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "abbreviation": "DG", "qualifierName": "diagnostic imaging"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "PA", "qualifierName": "pathology"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "PP", "qualifierName": "physiopathology"}]}}, {"maj